## Objects

### ext:Thing

Thing has its own Transform.

| Component | Field | Flags | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| [ext:Transform](#exttransform) | `Transform` |  |  |
| [ext:Stamp](#extstamp) | `Stamp` |  |  |

### game:Boss

| Component | Field | Flags | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| [game:Transform](#gametransform) | `Transform` | embedded (Common) |  |

### game:Hero

Hero is the player character.

It can carry a weapon.

| Component | Field | Flags | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| [game:Transform](#gametransform) | `Transform` | embedded (Common.Base) | Where the hero is. |
| [game:Health](#gamehealth) | `Health` |  | Stores the hero's health. |
| [game:Companion](#gamecompanion) | `Companion` | readonly |  |
| [game:Weapon](#gameweapon) | `Weapon` | optional | The weapon the hero carries, if any. |

