- [game:Hero](#gamehero)

### game:Health

Health is hit points.

It never drops below zero.

Go type: `example.com/game.Health`

| Field | Type | Required | Nullable | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `Current` | `integer (int64)` | yes |  |  |
| `Max` | `integer (int64)` | yes |  |  |

**Used by**

- [game:Hero](#gamehero)

### game:Score

Score is not used by any object yet.

Go type: `example.com/game.Score`

| Field | Type | Required | Nullable | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `Mode` | `enum (ScoreSum, ScoreBest)` | yes |  | How points are counted. Values: `0 ScoreSum`: Every point counts; `1 ScoreBest`. Default: `ScoreBest`. |
| `Points` | `integer (int64)` | yes |  | Default: `10`. |

**Used by**

_No object uses it yet._

### game:Transform

Transform is a position.

Go type: `example.com/game.Transform`

| Field | Type | Required | Nullable | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `X` | `number (double)` | yes |  | Horizontal \| position. |
| `Y` | `number (double)` | yes |  |  |

**Used by**

- [game:Boss](#gameboss) — embedded (Common)
- [game:Hero](#gamehero) — embedded (Common.Base)

